sequenceDiagram
    actor Main
    participant Element as SourceCodeFile
    participant Visitor as SecurityAuditVisitor
    Main->>Element: accept(visitor)
    Element->>Visitor: visit(this)
    Note over Element,Visitor: Compile-time overload selects visit(SourceCodeFile)
    Visitor->>Visitor: inspect source content and risk flag
    Visitor-->>Main: findings stored in visitor
